OL,5,G2200 1976: Those Were the Days
OL,6,     FA cast of celebrities feature in
OL,7,     Fthis series exploring years via
OL,8,     Farchive. In 1976, Bill Grundy met
OL,9,     Fthe Sex Pistols, Bob Marley came
OL,10,     Funder fire, and a pile of bricks
OL,11,     Fshocked the art world. (Ep1)
OL,12,G0000 Taggart
OL,13,     FNew DCI Matt Burke takes over the
OL,14,     Fcase of the murder of a
OL,15,     Fpolitician's activist son, who
OL,16,     Fthreatened his father's property
OL,17,     Fdeal. Is Jardine too close to the
OL,18,     Ftruth?
